## Core Features & Requirements

### 1. User Management

#### Client Features
- **Registration:** Email, phone, social login (Google, Facebook)
- **Profile Management:** Name, photo, contact info, addresses
- **Multiple Addresses:** Home, office, other with GPS coordinates
- **Payment Methods:** Save multiple cards, mobile money
- **Booking History:** View past and upcoming bookings
- **Reviews Given:** Track ratings provided to professionals

#### Professional Features
- **Application Process:** Submit credentials, experience, references
- **Profile:** Bio, photo, certifications, portfolio (10 photos max)
- **Services Offered:** Select categories and specialties
- **Availability Management:** Set weekly schedule, block dates
- **Service Radius:** Define working area (default 20km)
- **Earnings Dashboard:** Track income, jobs, performance metrics
- **Bank Account:** Add verified account for withdrawals

#### Admin Features
- **Dashboard:** Platform metrics, revenue, user activity
- **User Management:** Suspend/ban problematic users
- **Professional Verification:** Approve/reject applications
- **Dispute Resolution:** Handle reports and conflicts
- **System Settings:** Configure platform parameters

### 2. Service Categories

**Core Services (MVP):**
1. 🔧 **Plumbing** - Leak repairs, installations, drain cleaning
2. 🎨 **Painting** - Interior/exterior painting, touch-ups
3. 🪚 **Carpentry** - Furniture repair, installations, custom work
4. 🧱 **Tiling** - Floor/wall tiling, tile repairs
5. ⚡ **Electrical** - Wiring, fixture installation, repairs
6. 🧹 **Cleaning** - House cleaning, deep cleaning
7. 🔨 **General Repairs** - Handyman services, misc repairs

**Service Attributes:**
- Name, slug, description, icon
- Base price, estimated duration
- Number of active professionals
- Average rating

### 3. Booking Flow (< 2 Minutes Target)

**Client Booking Process (7 Steps):**
1. **Select Service Category** - Tap service icon on home screen
2. **Choose Address** - Current location, saved address, or add new
3. **Pick Date & Time** - Calendar with time slots (morning/afternoon/evening)
4. **Describe Job** - Optional text (max 500 chars) + photos
5. **View Available Professionals** - List with ratings, distance, price
6. **Review Price Estimate** - Breakdown with platform fee
7. **Confirm Booking** - Review details, select payment method, confirm

**Professional Job Flow:**
1. **Receive Notification** - Push notification with job details
2. **View Job Details** - Service, location, time, client rating, earnings
3. **Accept/Decline** - 15-minute response window
4. **Job Added to Schedule** - Calendar view with all bookings
5. **Start Job** - GPS verification when arriving at location
6. **Complete Job** - Upload photos, adjust price if needed, submit
7. **Receive Payment** - Funds added to available balance

### 4. Professional Discovery & Matching

**Search Algorithm:**
- **Primary Factors:**
  - Service category match
  - Availability on requested date/time
  - Within service radius (distance calculation)
- **Ranking Factors:**
  - Average rating (weighted 40%)
  - Distance from client (weighted 30%)
  - Response time (weighted 15%)
  - Acceptance rate (weighted 10%)
  - Number of completed jobs (weighted 5%)

**Professional Profile Display:**
- Profile photo, name, specialty
- Overall rating (1-5 stars) with review count
- Years of experience
- Jobs completed count
- Certifications and badges
- Hourly rate or base price
- Response time
- Distance from client location
- Sample reviews (3-5 most recent)

### 5. Trust & Safety

**Professional Vetting Process:**
1. **Application Review:**
   - Minimum 2 years experience required
   - Valid ID/license verification
   - Professional certifications
   - Two references (contacted by phone)
2. **Background Checks:**
   - Criminal record check (automated API)
   - ID verification
   - Reference verification
3. **Ongoing Monitoring:**
   - Rating and review tracking
   - Complaint monitoring
   - Annual re-verification

**Safety Features:**
- ✅ All professionals background checked
- ✅ Insurance coverage (R10,000 per booking)
- ✅ In-app messaging (recorded)
- ✅ GPS tracking during jobs
- ✅ Emergency report button
- ✅ 24-hour cancellation policy
- ✅ Dispute resolution system

### 6. Ratings & Reviews

**Multi-Category Rating System:**
- **Overall Rating:** 1-5 stars (required)
- **Punctuality:** Did they arrive on time?
- **Quality:** Was the work done well?
- **Professionalism:** Were they courteous and professional?
- **Value:** Was it worth the price?

**Review Features:**
- Written review (optional, max 500 chars)
- Photo uploads (up to 5 photos)
- "Would recommend" checkbox
- Professional can respond to reviews
- Reviews verified from actual bookings

### 7. Communication

**In-App Messaging:**
- Real-time chat via WebSocket
- Message types: text, image, location
- Read receipts
- Message history preserved
- Push notifications for new messages
- Professional can only message after job accepted

**Direct Calling:**
- Tap-to-call functionality
- Optional number masking for privacy
- Call logs tracked (for disputes)

### 8. Payments & Pricing

**Payment Flow:**
1. Client books service → Price estimate shown
2. Job completed → Professional can adjust price (with reason)
3. Client approves final price
4. Payment processed automatically
5. Platform fee deducted (18%)
6. Professional earnings added to balance
7. Digital receipt sent to client

**Payment Methods:**
- Credit/Debit cards (Stripe)
- Mobile money (PayStack/Flutterwave)
- Cash on completion (limited)

**Pricing Structure:**
- Base rate (per hour or per job)
- Platform fee: 18% of total
- Emergency service: +R100
- Tip option after service (100% to professional)

**Professional Withdrawals:**
- Minimum withdrawal: R500
- Processing fee: R25
- Transfer time: 1-3 business days
- Weekly or instant payout options

### 9. Real-Time Features

**WebSocket Events:**
- New job notifications (professional)
- Booking status updates
- Real-time messaging
- Professional location tracking (during job)
- Typing indicators
- Online/offline status

**Live Tracking:**
- Professional location updated every 30 seconds
- ETA calculation
- Map view showing route
- "Professional is on the way" notification
- "Professional has arrived" notification

### 10. Notifications

**Client Notifications:**
- Booking confirmed
- Professional assigned
- Professional accepted job
- Reminder 24 hours before
- Reminder 1 hour before
- Professional is on the way (10 min)
- Professional has arrived
- Job started
- Job completed
- Reminder to rate and review

**Professional Notifications:**
- New job request (with 15-min timer)
- Job cancelled by client
- Reminder of upcoming job
- Payment received
- New message from client
- New review received
- Badge earned
- Withdrawal processed

**Delivery Methods:**
- Push notifications (primary)
- SMS (important updates)
- Email (summaries, receipts)
- User preferences configurable

### 11. Admin Dashboard

**Key Metrics:**
- Total users (clients, professionals)
- Active bookings today/week/month
- Total revenue
- Average booking value
- Professional acceptance rate
- Client satisfaction score (average rating)
- Platform growth trends

**Admin Functions:**
- Approve/reject professional applications
- Review background check results
- Manage service categories
- Handle disputes and reports
- Issue refunds
- Suspend/ban users
- View detailed booking information
- Generate reports
- Configure system settings

### 12. Performance Requirements

**Speed:**
- App load time: < 2 seconds
- API response time: < 200ms (p95)
- Search results: < 1 second
- Booking flow completion: < 2 minutes
- Image loading: Progressive (thumbnails first)

**Scalability:**
- Support 10,000+ concurrent users
- Handle 100,000+ bookings per month
- Database query optimization (indexes, caching)
- Auto-scaling based on load

**Reliability:**
- 99.9% uptime SLA
- Automated backups (daily full, hourly incremental)
- Disaster recovery plan
- Graceful degradation
- Circuit breakers for external services

**Mobile-First:**
- Works on low-end devices
- Optimized for 3G networks
- App size < 20MB
- Offline mode for viewing bookings
- Progressive Web App (PWA) support

