## Database Schema

### Core Tables (25 Tables)

1. **users** - Base table for all user types
2. **clients** - Client-specific data
3. **addresses** - Client service addresses
4. **professionals** - Professional profiles and metrics
5. **professional_availability** - Weekly schedules
6. **professional_blocked_dates** - Unavailable dates
7. **service_categories** - Service types
8. **professional_services** - Professional-to-service mapping
9. **bookings** - Core booking records
10. **booking_status_history** - Audit trail
11. **booking_photos** - Before/after photos
12. **reviews** - Client reviews
13. **review_photos** - Review attachments
14. **messages** - In-app chat
15. **payments** - Transaction records
16. **payment_methods** - Saved payment methods
17. **withdrawals** - Professional payouts
18. **notifications** - All notifications
19. **professional_applications** - Join requests
20. **reports** - Disputes and issues
21. **referral_codes** - Referral program
22. **promo_codes** - Discount codes
23. **promo_code_usage** - Promo tracking
24. **professional_badges** - Achievements
25. **system_settings** - Configuration

### Key Relationships
- users (1) ↔ (1) clients/professionals/admins
- clients (1) ↔ (many) addresses
- clients (1) ↔ (many) bookings
- professionals (1) ↔ (many) bookings
- professionals (1) ↔ (many) professional_services
- bookings (1) ↔ (many) messages
- bookings (1) ↔ (1) reviews
- bookings (1) ↔ (1) payments

### Database Indexes (Critical)
- `idx_bookings_client_scheduled` on bookings(client_id, scheduled_date)
- `idx_bookings_professional_status` on bookings(professional_id, booking_status)
- `idx_professionals_location` on professionals(lat, lng) using GIST
- `idx_reviews_professional_rating` on reviews(professional_id, overall_rating)
- `idx_messages_booking_created` on messages(booking_id, created_at)

---

## API Specification

### Base URL
- **Production:** `https://api.thehandyman.com/v1`
- **Staging:** `https://api-staging.thehandyman.com/v1`
- **Development:** `http://localhost:3000/api/v1`

### Authentication
- **Type:** JWT (JSON Web Token)
- **Header:** `Authorization: Bearer <token>`
- **Token Expiry:** 1 hour (access), 30 days (refresh)

### Core Endpoints (60+ Total)

**Authentication (8 endpoints):**
- `POST /auth/register/client` - Client registration
- `POST /auth/register/professional` - Professional registration
- `POST /auth/login` - Login
- `POST /auth/social/google` - Google OAuth
- `POST /auth/refresh` - Refresh token
- `POST /auth/logout` - Logout
- `GET /auth/me` - Get current user
- `POST /auth/forgot-password` - Password reset

**Service Categories (2 endpoints):**
- `GET /service-categories` - List all categories
- `GET /service-categories/{id}` - Get category details

**Professionals (3 endpoints):**
- `POST /professionals/search` - Search available professionals
- `GET /professionals/{id}` - Get professional profile
- `GET /professionals/{id}/reviews` - Get professional reviews

**Bookings (11 endpoints):**
- `POST /bookings` - Create booking
- `GET /bookings` - Get my bookings
- `GET /bookings/{id}` - Get booking details
- `POST /bookings/{id}/cancel` - Cancel booking
- `POST /bookings/{id}/reschedule` - Reschedule booking
- `POST /bookings/{id}/start` - Start job (professional)
- `POST /bookings/{id}/complete` - Complete job (professional)
- `POST /bookings/{id}/accept` - Accept job (professional)
- `POST /bookings/{id}/decline` - Decline job (professional)
- `GET /bookings/{id}/messages` - Get booking messages
- `POST /bookings/{id}/messages` - Send message

**Reviews (3 endpoints):**
- `POST /bookings/{id}/review` - Create review
- `PATCH /reviews/{id}` - Update review
- `POST /reviews/{id}/respond` - Professional response

**Addresses (5 endpoints):**
- `POST /addresses` - Create address
- `GET /addresses` - Get my addresses
- `PATCH /addresses/{id}` - Update address
- `DELETE /addresses/{id}` - Delete address
- `POST /addresses/{id}/set-default` - Set default

**Payments (5 endpoints):**
- `POST /payment-methods` - Add payment method
- `GET /payment-methods` - Get payment methods
- `DELETE /payment-methods/{id}` - Delete payment method
- `POST /payments` - Process payment
- `GET /payments` - Payment history

**Professional Earnings (3 endpoints):**
- `GET /professionals/me/earnings` - Earnings summary
- `POST /withdrawals` - Request withdrawal
- `GET /withdrawals` - Withdrawal history

**Notifications (4 endpoints):**
- `GET /notifications` - Get notifications
- `POST /notifications/{id}/read` - Mark as read
- `POST /notifications/read-all` - Mark all as read
- `PATCH /users/me/notification-preferences` - Update preferences

**Reports (3 endpoints):**
- `POST /reports` - Create report
- `GET /reports` - Get my reports
- `GET /reports/{id}` - Get report details

**Admin (10+ endpoints):**
- `GET /admin/dashboard` - Dashboard stats
- `GET /admin/applications` - Professional applications
- `POST /admin/applications/{id}/approve` - Approve application
- `POST /admin/applications/{id}/reject` - Reject application
- `GET /admin/reports` - All reports/disputes
- `POST /admin/reports/{id}/resolve` - Resolve dispute
- `POST /admin/users/{id}/suspend` - Suspend user

### Response Format
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { ... },
  "meta": {
    "page": 1,
    "per_page": 20,
    "total": 100
  }
}
```

### Error Format
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
    "message": "Invalid input data",
    "details": [
      {
        "field": "email",
        "message": "Invalid email format"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

