- User registration and authentication
- 4 core services (Plumbing, Painting, Carpentry, Cleaning)
- Basic booking flow
- Professional profiles with ratings
- Payment integration (Stripe)
- Basic admin panel

**Phase 2 - Trust & Quality (Weeks 9-12):**
- Rating and review system
- Professional verification process
- In-app messaging
- Booking management (cancel, reschedule)
- Push notifications
- Email notifications

**Phase 3 - Scale & Optimize (Weeks 13-16):**
- Advanced matching algorithm
- GPS tracking
- Analytics dashboard
- Multiple payment methods
- Referral program
- Performance optimization

### Post-MVP Features (Months 4-6)
- Additional service categories (Electrical, Tiling, General Repairs)
- Professional badges and achievements
- Subscription plans for frequent users
- Advanced search filters
- Service packages and bundles
- Mobile app optimizations
- Marketing automation

### Launch Checklist
