## Risk Management

### Technical Risks
| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-------------|------------|
| Payment gateway downtime | High | Low | Backup payment provider, queue transactions |
| Database failure | Critical | Low | Multi-AZ deployment, automated backups |
| API rate limiting | Medium | Medium | Implement caching, optimize queries |
| Third-party API failures | Medium | Medium | Circuit breakers, fallback mechanisms |
| Security breach | Critical | Low | Regular audits, penetration testing |

### Business Risks
| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-------------|------------|
| Low professional adoption | High | Medium | Referral incentives, competitive rates |
| Client trust issues | High | Low | Rigorous vetting, insurance, reviews |
| Regulatory changes | Medium | Low | Legal counsel, compliance monitoring |
| Competition | Medium | High | Focus on quality, user experience |
| Seasonal demand fluctuations | Low | High | Diversify services, flexible pricing |

