## Glossary

**Artisan:** Skilled professional in a trade (plumber, carpenter, etc.)  
**Booking:** Service request from client to professional  
**Client:** User who books services  
**Professional:** Verified artisan offering services  
**Service Category:** Type of service (Plumbing, Painting, etc.)  
**Platform Fee:** Commission charged on bookings (18%)  
**Acceptance Rate:** Percentage of jobs accepted by professional  
**Response Time:** Average time for professional to respond to job requests  
**Booking Reference:** Unique identifier for booking (e.g., HM-2026-001234)  
**MVP:** Minimum Viable Product  
**SLA:** Service Level Agreement  
**ETA:** Estimated Time of Arrival  
**P95:** 95th percentile (performance metric)  
**RBAC:** Role-Based Access Control  
**JWT:** JSON Web Token  
**CDN:** Content Delivery Network  
**PWA:** Progressive Web App  

